WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.450
Lawful access and warrantless surveillance.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:08.762
CSE and CSIS metadata collection programs operate in legal grey zones.

00:00:08.762 --> 00:00:15.275
Telecommunications providers hand over subscriber data without warrants millions of times per year.
